__DISPLAY_NAME__ - test build
Build: __BUILD_ID__

Thanks for testing. This is an unreleased test copy of a RuneLite plugin.
It runs inside a RuneLite "developer client" started from this folder. It
does not touch your normal RuneLite install or its plugins.

WHAT IT DOES
  __DESCRIPTION__

WHAT YOU NEED
  - Windows 10 or 11
  - Java 11 or newer (https://adoptium.net, any "Temurin" 11/17/21 JDK or JRE)

START IT
  1. Unzip this whole folder somewhere (do not run it from inside the zip).
  2. Double-click START.bat.
  3. A RuneLite window opens with a log window behind it. Leave the log open.
  4. Find "__DISPLAY_NAME__" in the plugin list / sidebar and turn it on.

LOGGING IN (Jagex accounts)
  The developer client cannot use the Jagex Launcher directly. Follow
  "Using Jagex Accounts" here:
    https://github.com/runelite/runelite/wiki/Using-Jagex-Accounts
  In short: run the RuneLite launcher once with --insecure-write-credentials so
  it saves a login file, then start this test build. That login file lets
  anything on your PC log in as you, so delete it when you are done:
    %USERPROFILE%\.runelite\credentials.properties
  Old-style (non-Jagex) accounts can just log in normally.

SETTINGS
  The dev client shares %USERPROFILE%\.runelite with your normal RuneLite, so
  plugin settings you change here are kept there.

IF SOMETHING GOES WRONG
  - Window flashes and closes: open Command Prompt, run START.bat from there,
    and send a screenshot of what it prints.
  - Plugin does not show up: send the log window text (select all, copy).
  - Anything odd in game: tell me what you did, what you expected, what
    happened, and roughly when.

Please do not share this build with others. When you are done, delete this
folder; nothing else was installed.
